{"v":3,"catch":"水上噴射賽： 感受海浪的節奏！","desc":"「AQUA JET」 是 NAMCO (Bandai Namco Entertainment) 於 1996 年推出的一款海上運動遊戲。\n此遊戲因其大型水上摩托車式機殼而在當時的街機遊戲廳中脫穎而出。\n在 \"System Super 22 \"硬體栩栩如生的令人驚嘆的度假勝地風景中，在熾熱的陽光下馳騁於波光粼粼的浪花間，盡情享受快感！\n\n「Arcade Archives 2」系列包含「ORIGINAL MODE」、「HIGH SCORE MODE」、「CARAVAN MODE,」和「TIME ATTACK MODE」。\n它還擁有多個存檔槽、可讓您重新開始遊戲的倒帶功能，以及方便想要立即上手的快速啟動功能。\n在更有趣、更易用的「Arcade Archives 2」中，暢玩那些定義時代的經典街機遊戲。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["競速","運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e2e3ffbb3c2e824b64b5d0944bb78638ae3e084bab84ca7d98d13f7ff62c4369.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b8dda046c3d289a8e815bdd1c1a483a0efd4ca0907afdf6906af252fe00d304c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b7fff931938f0ad06a9b45f2c76abdcdcd945c3bca49073795397b607bddfa0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d4457da14d89e0f4c82fbff92457d3e93a7c178bf5ac7d08389af387abd44f3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c5aa9faaf6cacaf3e45aaea2dbabad5967807e1af99f6f661e489c17690fbc8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d5529f55356244a7c8d5e2266f92f22a5f6a3214ff5d5cc2b4ad0d3741f369ea.jpg"],"titleId":"0400f98023d16000","dlc":[]}